# Service Installed With Binary In Unusual Path (svchost-hosted DLL) | T1543.003 | Hub
source="WinEventLog:Microsoft-Windows-Sysmon/Operational" EventCode=13 TargetObject="*\\Services\\*" TargetObject="*\\Parameters\\ServiceDll" NOT (Details IN ("C:\\Windows\\System32\\*", "%SystemRoot%\\System32\\*", "%systemroot%\\system32\\*"))
